        into account\n86008 The date from which the weekly amount of a claimant’s net earnings are taken
        into account\ndepends upon whether\n\n\n1. there are already regular earnings in payment\n\n\n\
        \      1.1 at the date of claim for SPC or\n\n\n      1.2 following the end of an AIP or\n\n\n\
        2. earnings become payable whilst SPC is in payment or\n\n\n3. the amount of existing earnings
